00:19:57.927 --> 00:19:59.510
But I'm sure Cloud
Functions have also

00:19:59.510 --> 00:20:01.012
come a long way since then.

00:20:01.012 --> 00:20:01.970
JEN PERSON: Yeah, yeah.

00:20:01.970 --> 00:20:06.186
Cloud Functions for Firebase
