00:20:16.790 --> 00:20:19.982
So we are continuing to add
different types of triggers.

00:20:19.982 --> 00:20:21.440
I'm trying to guess
which ones have

00:20:21.440 --> 00:20:23.180
been added since the previous--

00:20:23.180 --> 00:20:25.222
MARK MIRCHANDANI: Guessing
